    <header class="site-header" id="top">
      <p class="brand">{{name}}</p>
      <nav aria-label="Site sections">
        <ul>
          <li><a href="#sec-1">{{sections.0}}</a></li>
          <li><a href="#sec-2">{{sections.1}}</a></li>
          <li><a href="#sec-3">{{sections.2}}</a></li>
        </ul>
      </nav>
    </header>

    <main id="main">
      <h1>{{name}}</h1>
      <p>{{who}}</p>
      <p><a class="button" href="#enquiry">{{mainAction.label}}</a></p>

      <section id="sec-1">
        <h2>{{sections.0}}</h2>
        <p>A couple of sentences about this section.</p>
      </section>

      <section id="sec-2">
        <h2>{{sections.1}}</h2>
        <p>A couple of sentences about this section.</p>
      </section>

      <section id="sec-3">
        <h2>{{sections.2}}</h2>
        <p>A couple of sentences about this section.</p>
      </section>

      <section id="offer">
        <h2>What we offer</h2>
        <div class="cards">
          {{#each items}}<article class="card">
            <h3>{{title}}</h3>
            <p>{{text}}</p>
            <p class="price">{{price}}</p>
          </article>
          {{/each}}
        </div>
      </section>

      <section id="enquiry">
        <h2>{{mainAction.label}}</h2>
        <form action="/enquiry" method="post">
          <p>
            <label for="f-name">What should we call you?</label><br>
            <input id="f-name" name="name" type="text" autocomplete="name" required>
          </p>
          <p>
            <label for="f-phone">Phone</label><br>
            <input id="f-phone" name="phone" type="tel" autocomplete="tel" required>
          </p>
          <p><button type="submit">{{mainAction.label}}</button></p>
        </form>
      </section>
    </main>


    <section data-scaffold id="classify">
      <h2>Static or dynamic</h2>
      <table>
        <tr><th>Part of the site</th><th>Static or dynamic</th><th>Why</th></tr>
        {{#each sections}}<tr class="part"><td>{{.}}</td><td class="kind">static</td><td class="why">The text of a section rarely changes, so it is served as a ready file.</td></tr>
        {{/each}}
        <tr class="part items"><td>List of offers</td><td class="kind">static</td><td class="why">The list rarely changes: when I edit the site it is rebuilt, and everything lies there as ready files.</td></tr>
        <tr class="part form"><td>Enquiry form</td><td class="kind">dynamic</td><td class="why">An enquiry has to be received and passed to the owner, so a server or an intermediary service must do that.</td></tr>
        <tr class="part login"><td>Visitor login</td><td class="kind">dynamic</td><td class="why">A login checks a password and remembers a person, and that is the server’s work; it isn’t needed yet, but with it the site would become dynamic.</td></tr>
      </table>
      <p id="db">Do I need a database: later. Right now the content rarely changes and fits in files, so a database isn’t needed; enquiries go to email through an intermediary service. If a login or orders appear, a database will be needed to store people and enquiries.</p>
      <p id="cache">Caching: the pages are static, so they are cached whole: a Cache-Control header and a CDN hand out the ready file without troubling the server, and the dynamic part (the form) should not be cached.</p>
    </section>

    <footer class="site-footer">
      <p>{{name}}, {{city}}</p>
    </footer>
  </body>
</html>
